msgid "Debug plugin email notifications are working."
msgstr "Notifikasi email plugin Debug berfungsi."

msgid "Could not send the test notification. Check your mail setup."
msgstr "Tidak dapat mengirim notifikasi tes. Periksa pengaturan email Anda."

