msgstr "Pengaturan"

msgid "Error Log"
msgstr "Log Kesalahan"

msgid "You do not have permission to access this page."
msgstr "Anda tidak memiliki izin untuk mengakses halaman ini."

msgid "Debug Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Debug"

msgid "Debug settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan debug"

msgid "Enable Email Notification"
msgstr "Aktifkan Notifikasi Email"

msgid "Email Address"
msgstr "Alamat Email"

msgid "Enable Error Reporting"
msgstr "Aktifkan Pelaporan Kesalahan"

msgid "Create Error Log in File"
msgstr "Buat Log Kesalahan di File"

msgid "Display Errors on the website"
msgstr "Tampilkan Kesalahan di Situs Web"

msgid "Enable Script Debug"
msgstr "Aktifkan Debug Script"

msgid "Enable Save Queries"
msgstr "Aktifkan Simpan Kueri"

msgid "These settings update your wp-config.php file. A timestamped backup is created automatically before each save; you can restore it below."
msgstr "Pengaturan ini memperbarui file wp-config.php Anda. Cadangan berstempel waktu dibuat otomatis sebelum setiap penyimpanan; Anda dapat memulihkannya di bawah ini."

msgid "Save Changes"
msgstr "Simpan Perubahan"

msgid "Send Test Notification"
msgstr "Kirim Notifikasi Tes"

msgid "Sends a test email to verify your notification setup."
msgstr "Mengirim email tes untuk memverifikasi pengaturan notifikasi Anda."

msgid "wp-config.php Backups & Restore"
msgstr "Cadangan & Pemulihan wp-config.php"

msgid "The most recent backups are listed newest-first. Restoring returns your wp-config.php to that saved state. The latest 10 backups are kept automatically."
msgstr "Cadangan terbaru dicantumkan paling awal. Pemulihan mengembalikan wp-config.php Anda ke keadaan tersimpan tersebut. 10 cadangan terbaru disimpan secara otomatis."

msgid "Backup file"
msgstr "File cadangan"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "Tindakan"

msgid "Restore"
msgstr "Pulihkan"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Hapus"

msgid "Debug Log"
msgstr "Log Debug"

msgid "Clear Log"
msgstr "Bersihkan Log"

msgid "Download Log"
msgstr "Unduh Log"

msgid "Auto-refresh every 5s"
msgstr "Perbarui otomatis setiap 5 detik"

msgid "No Log File Found"
msgstr "Tidak Ada File Log Ditemukan"

msgid "Debug your WordPress site, multisite and plugins. Debug is a development/production tool that helps you remove bugs from your WordPress website."
msgstr "Debug situs WordPress Anda, multisite, dan plugin. Debug adalah alat pengembangan/produksi yang membantu menghapus bug dari situs web WordPress Anda."

